BT /F1 10 Tf 54 729 Td (The four legal entities in scope for ICRECON are Meridian Instruments Ltd \(UK\), Meridian) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 716 Td (Instruments B.V. \(NL\), Meridian Instruments Inc. \(US\) and Meridian Instruments Sdn. Bhd. \(MY\).) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 691 Td (3. System landscape) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 669 Td (The following hosts are involved in month-end close. All are in the Leeds data centre unless) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 656 Td (stated otherwise.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 635 Td (Host | Role | Notes for close) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 623 Td (atlas-app-prd-01.meridian.internal | Application tier node 1 | Load balanced with nodes 2 to 4) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 611 Td (atlas-app-prd-02.meridian.internal | Application tier node 2 | Load balanced) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 599 Td (atlas-app-prd-03.meridian.internal | Application tier node 3 | Load balanced) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 587 Td (atlas-app-prd-04.meridian.internal | Application tier node 4 | Load balanced; hosts the Finance) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 575 Td (power-user pool) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 563 Td (atlas-db-prd-01.meridian.internal | Primary database | All batch writes; archive logs on) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 551 Td (/u02/arch) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 539 Td (atlas-db-prd-02.meridian.internal | Standby replica | Used for reporting offload during close) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 527 Td (atlas-batch-prd-01.meridian.internal | Batch scheduler | Hosts the MEC_BATCH queue) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 515 Td (atlas-rpt-prd-01.meridian.internal | Reporting server | Close report archive share) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 493 Td (The standby replica atlas-db-prd-02.meridian.internal receives redo from the primary) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 480 Td (continuously. During the close window, Finance reporting queries are redirected to the standby) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 467 Td (so that heavy ad-hoc reporting does not compete with the batch chain on the primary. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 454 Td (redirection is a reporting data-source switch in the Atlas reporting configuration and does not) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 441 Td (require a change record, because it is a documented operational step of this runbook.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 416 Td (4. Roles and responsibilities) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 395 Td (Role | Who | Responsibility) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 383 Td (Close coordinator | Financial Controller, Group Finance | Owns the close calendar, approves job) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 371 Td (releases, signs off the period) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 359 Td (Atlas support engineer | IT Business Applications on-duty engineer | Executes this runbook,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 347 Td (monitors batch jobs and infrastructure) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 335 Td (Atlas team lead | Aoife Gallagher | Escalation point for technical decisions, approves) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 323 Td (deviations from this runbook) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 311 Td (Database administrator | IT Infrastructure DBA on rota | Database health, archive logs, standby) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 299 Td (lag, backup verification) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 287 Td (Payroll lead | Group Payroll, HR | Confirms payroll data is final before PAYX-MONTHLY) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 275 Td (Group Treasury | Treasury analyst on duty | Signs off unusual exchange-rate movements before) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 263 Td (FXLOAD is released) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 251 Td (Service desk | Beacon first-line analysts | Triages ATLAS-FIN and ATLAS-PAYX tickets, routes to) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 239 Td (the Atlas support engineer) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 227 Td (ECAB chair | Head of IT Operations or delegate | Approves emergency changes during the freeze) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 202 Td (5. Close calendar) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 181 Td (Day | Time \(UK\) | Activity | Owner) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 169 Td (BD-3 | Before 18:00 | Last approved changes complete; pre-close checks | Atlas support engineer) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 157 Td (BD-3 | 22:00 | Pre-close full backup, tagged MEC-YYYYMM | DBA) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 145 Td (BD-2 | 09:15 | Close window opens; first MEC Bridge stand-up | Close coordinator) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 133 Td (BD-2 | 10:00 | Reporting redirected to standby; ACCRUE released | Atlas support engineer) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 121 Td (BD-1 | 09:15 | Stand-up | Close coordinator) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 109 Td (BD-1 | 15:30 \(16:30 CET\) | FXLOAD rate load and variance check | Atlas support engineer, Group) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 97 Td (Treasury) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 85 Td (BD-1 | After FXLOAD | ICRECON released and reviewed | Atlas support engineer, entity) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 73 Td (accountants) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 61 Td (BD+1 | 09:15 | Stand-up | Close coordinator) Tj ET
endstream
