10 0 obj
<< /Length 5468 >>
stream
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 729 Td (7. Join the 09:15 stand-up in the MEC Bridge Teams channel. Confirm the close calendar with) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 716 Td (   the Financial Controller and post the pre-close check results.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 703 Td (8. Redirect Finance reporting to the standby replica. In the Atlas reporting configuration,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 690 Td (   switch the "Finance reporting" data source to atlas-db-prd-02.meridian.internal and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 677 Td (   confirm that a sample report runs. Post confirmation in the MEC Bridge.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 664 Td (9. Ask the service desk lead to raise the default priority of the Beacon category ATLAS-FIN) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 651 Td (   to P2 for the duration of the window. ATLAS-PAYX tickets keep their normal P2 default.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 638 Td (   Confirm that the Beacon routing rule sends both categories to the Atlas support queue.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 625 Td (10. Check the batch queue with atlasctl batch status --queue MEC_BATCH. All six month-end jobs) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 612 Td (   should show as scheduled and held. If any job is not held, hold it immediately \(for) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 599 Td (   example atlasctl job hold ACCRUE\) and investigate why the hold was not applied by the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 586 Td (   scheduler template.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 573 Td (11. When the Financial Controller approves in the MEC Bridge, release ACCRUE with atlasctl job) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 560 Td (   release ACCRUE.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 547 Td (12. Monitor ACCRUE to completion. Typical run time is 35 to 50 minutes. On completion, send) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 534 Td (   the accrual summary report to the Financial Controller and wait for confirmation that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 521 Td (   accrual totals are as expected for each entity.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54 507 Td (Phase C: Exchange rates and intercompany \(BD-1\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 485 Td (13. Join the 09:15 stand-up. Confirm that FXLOAD is still held with atlasctl batch status) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 472 Td (   --queue MEC_BATCH and that the ECB rate feed connector reported a successful connection) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 459 Td (   test in the previous 24 hours.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 446 Td (14. FXLOAD loads the ECB reference rates at 16:30 CET on BD-1 \(15:30 UK time\). Once the rates) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 433 Td (   are staged, run the variance check and compare every currency against the previous) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 420 Td (   business day's rate. If any currency has moved by more than 3% versus the previous) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 407 Td (   business day, keep FXLOAD on hold with atlasctl job hold FXLOAD and do not post the rates) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 394 Td (   until Group Treasury has signed off the movement in the MEC Bridge. Record the currency,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 381 Td (   both rates and the Treasury approver in the close ticket.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 368 Td (15. When the variance check passes, or Group Treasury has signed off, release FXLOAD with) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 355 Td (   atlasctl job release FXLOAD and confirm that period-end revaluation postings were created) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 342 Td (   for all four entities.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 329 Td (16. Release ICRECON. The job reconciles intercompany balances between Meridian Instruments Ltd) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 316 Td (   \(UK\), Meridian Instruments B.V. \(NL\), Meridian Instruments Inc. \(US\) and Meridian) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 303 Td (   Instruments Sdn. Bhd. \(MY\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 290 Td (17. Distribute the ICRECON exception report to the entity accountants. Mismatches below the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 277 Td (   Finance tolerance are cleared by Finance; mismatches caused by interface failures \(for) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 264 Td (   example missing shipments from the Penang factory stock transfers\) are logged as ATLAS-FIN) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 251 Td (   tickets and investigated by the Atlas support engineer.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 238 Td (18. Check /u02/arch on atlas-db-prd-01 at the end of BD-1, because ACCRUE, FXLOAD and ICRECON) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 225 Td (   generate heavy redo. If usage has reached 85%, the DBA runs the archive log purge job) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 212 Td (   ARCH-PURGE, but only after confirming that standby apply lag on) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 199 Td (   atlas-db-prd-02.meridian.internal is under 5 minutes. Purging archive logs that the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 186 Td (   standby has not yet applied will break the standby and remove the reporting offload for) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 173 Td (   the rest of the close.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54 159 Td (Phase D: Ledger reconciliation and payroll \(BD+1\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 137 Td (19. Join the 09:15 stand-up. Confirm that all ICRECON exceptions are either cleared or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 124 Td (   accepted by the Financial Controller.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 111 Td (20. Release GLRECON with atlasctl job release GLRECON. Typical run time is 60 to 90 minutes.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 98 Td (21. Send the GLRECON tie-out report to the Financial Controller. Any subledger that does not) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 85 Td (   tie out is recorded in the close ticket and must be resolved or explicitly accepted before) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 72 Td (   CLOSE-LOCK.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 59 Td (22. Before releasing PAYX-MONTHLY, verify the Calderbrook Payroll SFTP host key fingerprint.) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
